# Q213_TrialOfTheSeeker, start with the diamonds already paid: the character holds the secondClassChange35 memo, so the start event gives no
# Dimensional Diamonds (no item message, no memo write) and the accept page is the plain one, not the "a" page.
# Hand-written from the quest script (no reference trace).
character Seeker 36
class 7
memo secondClassChange35 true
script quest.Q213_TrialOfTheSeeker
item 2647 2648 2649 2650 2651 2652 2653 2654 2655 2656 2657 2658 2659 2660 2661 2662 2663 2664 2665 2666 2667 2668 2669 2670 2671 2672 2673 7562
page trainer/30106.htm
page trainer/30064.htm
page trainer/30526.htm
page merchant/30684.htm
page trainer/30715.htm
page script/quest/Q213_TrialOfTheSeeker/
npc dufner 30106 Trainer 10 0 0
npc terry 30064 Trainer -10 0 0
npc brunon 30526 Trainer 0 10 0
npc viktor 30684 Merchant 0 -10 0
npc marina 30715 Trainer 20 20 0
npc ghoul 20198 Monster 40 0 0
npc antcaptain 20080 Monster -40 0 0
npc olmahum 20211 Monster 0 40 0
npc bugbear 20249 Monster 0 -40 0
npc turek 20495 Monster 40 40 0
npc medusa 20158 Monster -40 -40 0
npc stakato 20234 Monster 40 -40 0
npc breka 20270 Monster -40 40 0
npc antwarrior 20088 Monster 60 0 0
